b\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u5185\u306e\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u30ec\u30b8\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3068\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u5b9f\u969b\u306e\u4fdd\u5b58\u30fb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u6a5f\u80fd\u306f\u63d0\u4f9b**...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/savestates.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:53:40+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_mixer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/video_mixer/", "title": "video_mixer", "content_html": "<p><code>video_mixer</code> \u306f\u3001MiSTer \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u304c\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u591a\u304f\u306e\u6620\u50cf\u6a5f\u80fd\uff08\u30b9\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30c0\u30d6\u30eb\u3001\u30ac\u30f3\u30de\u3001HQ2x \u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u3001\u30d5\u30ea\u30fc\u30ba\u306a\u3069\uff09\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u30d8\u30eb\u30d1\u30fc\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2><code>video_mixer</code> \u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u5316</h2>\n<p>\u6b21\u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u3067\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>`LINE_LENGT...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_mixer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:53:40+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/updater/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/updater/", "title": "\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u5b9f\u884c", "content_html": "<p>\u521d\u3081\u3066\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u3057\u305f\u76f4\u5f8c\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u306e\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002\u65b0\u898f\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3057\u305f\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u306f\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30c8\u3068 Menu \u30b3\u30a2\u3057\u304b\u5165\u3063\u3066\u304a\u3089\u305a\u3001\u5404\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u3084\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3082\u53e4\u3044\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u63a5\u7d9a\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002\u6709\u7dda\u63a5\u7d9a\u304c\u306a\u3044...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/updater.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:53:40+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:52:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>Sony PlayStation\uff08PSX\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u3053\u308c\u307e\u3067\u3067\u6700\u3082\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u5145\u5b9f\u3057\u3001\u958b\u767a\u3082\u6d3b\u767a\u306a\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u8c4a\u5bcc\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</li>\n<li>BIOS \u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048</li>\n<li>\u624b\u52d5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c92\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8</li>\n<li>\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9</li>\n<li>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30c6\u30af\u30b9\u30c1\u30e3\u5909\u66f4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PSX ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:52:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/conf_str/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u8a2d\u5b9a\u6587\u5b57\u5217", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306e F12\uff08\u307e\u305f\u306f OSD \u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\uff09\u3067\u30c8\u30b0\u30eb\u3067\u304d\u308b\u30aa\u30f3\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\uff08OSD\uff09\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307e\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u3054\u3068\u306b\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u306b\u305d\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u5c02\u7528\u306e\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u8ffd\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u306f <code>emu</code> \u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f <code>emu</code> \u304c\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T04:52:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/nativeres/", "title": "Core Default Resolutions", "content_html": "<p>This chart shows each core's default native resolution, frequencies, and pixel clock at startup. These values are not static and are documented for reference...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/nativeres.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "title": "Advanced Networking", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer has several advanced networking features.</p>\n<h2>Network access</h2>\n<p>The MiSTer board can be accessed through the on-board Ethernet port. The system has *...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/network.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/genesis/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/genesis/", "title": "Genesis", "content_html": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> This core is publicly archived and no longer maintained; the hardware-accurate MegaDrive core by Nukeykt, developed from analysis of decapped chips...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/genesis.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/arcade_video/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/arcade_video/", "title": "arcade_video", "content_html": "<p><code>arcade_video</code> is used mostly in arcade cores. It provides helpers to optionally enable the scandoubler (based on ini settings), handle rotation on HDMI, and...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/arcade_video.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "title": "Core Configuration String", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer provides an on-screen display (OSD) that can be toggled on and off by pressing F12 on your keyboard (or OSD button). For each core that is loaded, thi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/hps_io/", "title": "hps_io", "content_html": "<p>HPS stands for Hard Processor System \u2014 the ARM part of the MiSTer FPGA. The <code>hps_io.sv</code> file contains the <code>hps_io</code> module, which talks to the MiSTer binary o...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/hps_io.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "title": "Arcade ROMs and MRA Files", "content_html": "<p>This page explains most of the intricacies of the way MiSTer handles ROMs for Arcade systems.</p>\n<h2>MRA Format</h2>\n<p>Because some arcade boards can change games by ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T02:21:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}